# Design system documentation sync

When `lib/core/theme.dart` tokens (`AppColors`, `kHeaderGradient`, `AppTheme`) or shared widgets under `lib/widgets/` change, update **`docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`** in the **same change**.

- Hex values and gradient stops must match `theme.dart` exactly.
- Also reconcile `.cursor/rules/design-system.mdc` colour list with `theme.dart` (build-time UI rule; it references `docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`).
- Document new recurring components if they become shared patterns.
